libmirage (3.3.1-3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * debian/rules:
    - Remove commented export.
    - Reorder targets.
    - Remove override_dh_makeshlibs and override_dh_shlibdeps, since
      they served no actual purpose and they made listing test
      dependencies harder.
  * debian/tests/control:
    - Add build-essential missing dependency that broke autopkgtest
      (closes: #1143977). Thanks to Sébastien Noel
      <sebastien@twolife.be> for the support.
    - Remove libsamplerate0 and libsndfile1 dependencies, since they
      will be automatically listed by "@" dependency, since
      override_dh_shlibdeps was removed from debian/rules.

 -- Matteo Bini <matteobin@tiepi.it>  Sun, 23 Aug 2026 17:22:43 +0200

