libmirage (3.3.1-1) experimental; urgency=medium

  * New upstream version.
  * debian/appstream/net.sf.cdemu.libmirage.metainfo.xml:
    - Change provided library soname from 11 to 12.
    - Add 3.3.0 and 3.3.1 releases.
  * debian/control:
    - Bump cmake minimum required version to 3.16.
    - Remove libgirepository1.0-dev dependency (closes: #1118877)
      and replace it with individual packages: gir1.2-gio-2.0-dev,
      gir1.2-gmodule-2.0-dev and gir1.2-gobject-2.0-dev.
      Also add minimum required version for gobject-introspection set
      to 1.80, to catch unsupported systems.
    - Add valac as build dependency to provide Vala bindings.
    - Bump Standards-Version to 4.7.4.
    - Change library soname from 11 to 12.
    - Remove devhelp recommendation (closes: #1121875).
  * debian/copyright:
    - Make the copyright fields as ASCII as possible.
    - Small edits to license fields.
  * debian/libmirage-dev.install:
    - Provide Vala bindings (closes: #1128922).
  * debian/libmirage11.*:
    - rename libmirage11 .docs, .install and .symbols files to new
      libmirage12 suffix.
  * debian/rules:
    - Change library version from 3.2 to 3.3.
  * debian/tests/*:
    - Add tests control file and vala-bindings one. Thanks to Sébastien
      Noel <sebastien@twolife.be> for the patch to provide Vala bindings
      and to test them.

 -- Matteo Bini <matteobin@tiepi.it>  Mon, 20 Jul 2026 20:16:10 +0200

